  &lt;/figcaption&gt;
 &lt;/figure&gt;
 &lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img alt="신규 니케 라푼젤 생츄어리" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/10/26/f56487f55606412c-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
