   신규 코스튬 나유타 삼독
  &lt;/figcaption&gt;
 &lt;/figure&gt;
 &lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img alt="신규 코스튬 라크리모사" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/10/26/50c95088b1f74db5-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
